      'mail.serverBtn': 'Mail server settings', 'mail.serverTitle': 'Mail server settings', 'mail.srvProvider': 'Provider',
      'mail.serverIntro': 'These are for the mail program on your computer or phone \u2014 a browser cannot talk to a mail server itself. Set your account up once there, and SportTactic simply hands its messages to it.',
